  <content>
  <section>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <para>Find the value of \(x\) that makes the equation true. </para>
</list>
<para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><title>Warm Up Activity</title><exercise data-content-id="bce4fcf6-8203-4fce-826f-388d9a3e712a"><problem><para>
      <para>\(2^3\cdot 2^4=2^x\) </para>
      <para> Enter your answer here:</para>
    </para></problem><solution><para>7</para><para>
      <para>Nice try! The correct answer is: 7</para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
